        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ida bought her first camera with her first pay cheque and left it on auto for a year. When she finally learned the three settings it took a weekend, because someone explained them plainly.</p><p>She has photographed portraits and events for eleven years and taught an evening class for six. Open Shade is that class, filmed. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
