        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Camera manuals explain buttons, not photos"
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A good camera comes with a manual of four hundred pages and a menu of ninety items. People in Ida's class kept asking the same things: why indoor photos come out dark, why the children are blurred, why the sky turns white. The course answers those first.</p>"
          }
        }
